    "Name": "Urbiestator",
    "Details": "The second production model of the Urbiestator, the -R2001 brings a total of 80 Enhanced LRM tubes for indirect fire while still carrying two Ultra AC/5 and two Gauss/20 for direct fire. A single, head mounted ER Large Laser provides secondary firepower.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: 360° Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.44</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
